---
Stdout:
ST120  Invalid Location
checks invalid_location

`Location` header of a `201` or `202` response that leads to `404 Not Found`.

Schemathesis sends one `GET` to the URL in `Location`, resolved against the
request URL: `42` returned by `POST /items` leads to `/42`, and to `/items/42`
only after `POST /items/`.

`--exclude-checks invalid_location` turns it off.
